; Run T only: appended to the uslab.test zone by `gen_lab.py --takeover`
; (UL_TAKEOVER_DNS=1 ./up.sh). Never served while ~herokuapp.com is not routed
; to the lab DNS: the host would then resolve these targets on the internet.
brokenapp-cname     IN CNAME brokenapp.herokuapp.com.
gone                IN CNAME ghostapp.herokuapp.com.
healthy             IN CNAME liveapp.herokuapp.com.
